statement:
Every finite tree-absorbed fiber CSP whose 2-connected incidence block
has cycle rank two falls into exactly one of four branches:
1. some theta path relation \(R_i\) is empty;
2. some pair intersection \(R_i\cap R_j\) is empty, giving an incoherent
   unicyclic subsystem;
3. every pair intersection is nonempty but
   \(R_1\cap R_2\cap R_3=\varnothing\), an intrinsic theta collision;
4. the triple intersection is nonempty and the block is coherent.
There is no fifth obstruction mechanism at cycle rank two.
